# =====================================================================
# What ships to GitHub is deliberately narrow:
#   README.md, LICENSE, the 72 projects' CODE (projects/**/src,tests),
#   the shared code they import (quant_lab/common + requirements.txt),
#   and the ReadTheDocs source (quant_lab/docs/).
# Everything listed below is kept LOCAL — planning, machinery, data,
# secrets, and the source corpus (which is folded into the docs, not
# shipped raw). Human-readable list: quant_lab/docs/published-manifest.md
# =====================================================================

# --- Secrets & tokens (NEVER commit) ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.token
**/secrets.toml
.streamlit/secrets.toml

# --- ALL data: raw, sample, curated — none of it ships ---
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal
*.parquet
*.feather
*.h5
*.sqlite
*.csv
data/
**/sample_data/

# --- Planning / internal (kept local) ---
/PORTFOLIO_SPEC.md
/TODO.md
/DATA_INVENTORY.md
# legacy section-12 spec (planning); not one of the 72 projects
/p01-market-data-foundation/
quant_lab/docs/published-manifest.md

# --- Source corpus: folded into the docs, never shipped raw ---
/RESUME_CONCEPT_TABLES.md
/RESUME_PROJECTS_DETAILED.md
quant_resumes/

# --- The brain / machinery: generates the output, but isn't shipped ---
quant_lab/concepts.json
quant_lab/scaffold.py
quant_lab/coverage.py
quant_lab/coverage.json
quant_lab/coverage.md
quant_lab/keyterms.json
quant_lab/cookiecutters/
quant_lab/graph.html
quant_lab/graph_data.json
quant_lab/GRAPH.md
quant_lab/README.md
projects/**/config.json
# upstox client + paper bot: not needed public; re-add genuinely-shared public code (tearsheet/eval) as it's built
quant_lab/common/
# local reference material (awesome-quant catalog + curation, github-survey): machinery, never shipped
quant_lab/reference/
# section paper-bot invoker (dev utility)
projects/**/run_papers.py
# harvested-paper dump — its content folds into the reading docs
projects/**/papers.md
# Upstox data adapter: needs a token, kept private
**/datalake/sources/upstox_source.py
# reads the local (unshipped) Bullseye DB: private
**/datalake/sources/bullseye_seed.py
# its offline mapper test (also private)
**/tests/test_upstox.py
# its offline test (also private)
**/tests/test_bullseye_seed.py

# --- Docs build artifacts ---
**/_build/
**/.doctrees/
site/

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# --- OS / editor ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
